This is to build sdcard image for rockpi4b:

Parts needed:
1. rockpi4b.
2. WD Black SN770 1TB NVMe SSD.  ( install kernel and rootfs in NVMe SSD )
3. Sandisk 64GB micro sdcard.    ( install u-boot in on board spi )
4. Host PC with ubuntu 26.04     ( ubuntu-resolute ).
5. M.2 NVMe SSD enclosure.
6. EMMC module.                  ( install android on EMMC )
7. USB2 SATA SSD
8. ASUS USB-BT500 bluetooth usb dongle.

Steps to build rockpi4b sdcard image:

1. git clone https://github.com/philipchen888/build-rockpi4b.git
   sudo apt update
   sudo apt upgrade
   sudo apt-get install build-essential git libssl-dev nmap net-tools libncurses5-dev libncursesw5-dev dnsutils vsftpd ftp binfmt-support qemu-user-binfmt scons libncurses5-dev libncursesw5-dev libdbus-glib-1-dev libbluetooth-dev python3-dev python3-pip python3-setuptools libcurl4-openssl-dev gettext dbus-x11 chrpath diffstat gawk texinfo curl flex bison device-tree-compiler swig libmpc-dev debootstrap debhelper kpartx gdisk devscripts isolinux po4a libgnutls28-dev mtools python-is-python3 python3-pyelftools gcc-aarch64-linux-gnu p7zip pandoc ffmpeg
   sudo update-binfmts --enable

2. Install live-build:
   sudo apt-get install debootstrap debhelper kpartx gdisk devscripts isolinux po4a live-build

   lb --version ( 3.0~a57-1 /usr/bin/lb )

   For forky, trixie and bookworm:
   wget http://deb.debian.org/debian/pool/main/l/live-build/live-build_20250814.tar.xz
   tar xvf live-build_20250814.tar.xz
   cd live-build
   sudo make install
   lb --version ( 20250814 /usr/bin/lb )

3. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/uboot  ( Download u-boot to spi )
   wget https://github.com/radxa/rock-pi-images-released/releases/download/v20210824/rockpi4b_debian_buster_xfce4_arm64_20210824_0233-gpt.img.gz
   gunzip rockpi4b_debian_buster_xfce4_arm64_20210824_0233-gpt.img.gz

   Burn rockpi4b_debian_buster_xfce4_arm64_20210824_0233-gpt.img to sdcard.
   sudo mount /dev/sda4 /mnt
   sudo vi /mnt/hw_intfc.conf ( change to intfc:uart4=off intfc:spi1=on intfc:dtoverlay=spi1-flash )
   sync; sudo umount /mnt
   Eject sdcard from PC
   Boot rockpi4b with sdcard.  ( username: rock, password: rock )

   Erase spi nor flash:
   ls /dev ( find mtdblock0 )
   sudo dd if=/dev/zero of=/dev/mtdblock0 bs=1M seek=0 count=4
   sync

   Install uboot to spi nor flash:
   sudo dd if=./uboot-trust-spi.img of=/dev/mtdblock0 bs=1M seek=0
   sync

4. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/linux ( Compile mainline kernel )
   git clone --depth=1 --branch v6.18 https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git
   vi ./linux/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig ( enable NVMe )

   vi ./linux/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3399-rock-pi-4.dtsi ( change i2c7 uart4 spi2 pwm1 )
   make kernel

   The results are in ./linux/tmp/lib/modules/*
                      ./linux/tmp/boot/*

5. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/rootfs-bookworm  ( Compile debian bookworm rootfs )
   make rootfs
   The results are in ./linaro-rootfs.img linaro-esp.img
   make clean

6. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/rootfs-trixie  ( Compile debian trixie rootfs )
   make rootfs
   The results are in ./linaro-rootfs.img linaro-esp.img
   make clean

7. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/rootfs-forky  ( Compile debian forky rootfs )
   make rootfs
   The results are in ./linaro-rootfs.img linaro-esp.img
   make clean

8. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/rootfs-ubuntu-noble  ( Compile ubuntu-noble rootfs )
   make rootfs
   The results are in ./linaro-rootfs.img linaro-esp.img
   make clean

9. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/rootfs-ubuntu-questing  ( Compile ubuntu-questing rootfs )
   make rootfs
   The results are in ./linaro-rootfs.img linaro-esp.img
   make clean

10. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/rootfs-ubuntu-resolute  ( Compile ubuntu-resolute rootfs )
    make rootfs
    The results are in ./linaro-rootfs.img linaro-esp.img
    make clean

11. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/bookworm-gnome  ( Build debian bookworm gnome-desktop image )
    Plugin NVME-SSD/sdcard/emmc/USB2-SATA-SSD to PC.
    sudo ./mksdcardimg.sh
    Eject NVME-SSD/sdcard/emmc/USB2-SATA-SSD from PC.

12. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/trixie-gnome    ( Build debian trixie gnome-desktop image )
    Plugin NVME-SSD/sdcard/emmc/USB2-SATA-SSD to PC.
    sudo ./mksdcardimg.sh
    Eject NVME-SSD/sdcard/emmc/USB2-SATA-SSD from PC.

13. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/forky-gnome     ( Build debian forky gnome-desktop image )
    Plugin NVME-SSD/sdcard/emmc/USB2-SATA-SSD to PC.
    sudo ./mksdcardimg.sh
    Eject NVME-SSD/sdcard/emmc/USB2-SATA-SSD from PC.

14. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/ubuntu-noble  ( Build ubuntu-noble image )
    Plugin NVME-SSD/sdcard/emmc/USB2-SATA-SSD to PC.
    sudo ./mksdcardimg.sh
    sudo mount /dev/sda2 /mnt
    sudo cp ./rtlbt/* /mnt/lib/firmware/rtl_bt && sync && sudo umount /mnt
    Eject NVME-SSD/sdcard/emmc/USB2-SATA-SSD from PC.

15. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/ubuntu-questing  ( Build ubuntu-questing image )
    Plugin NVME-SSD/sdcard/emmc/USB2-SATA-SSD to PC.
    sudo ./mksdcardimg.sh
    sudo mount /dev/sda2 /mnt
    sudo cp ./rtlbt/* /mnt/lib/firmware/rtl_bt && sync && sudo umount /mnt
    Eject NVME-SSD/sdcard/emmc/USB2-SATA-SSD from PC.

16. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/ubuntu-resolute  ( Build ubuntu-resolute image )
    Plugin NVME-SSD/sdcard/emmc/USB2-SATA-SSD to PC.
    sudo ./mksdcardimg.sh
    sudo mount /dev/sda2 /mnt
    sudo cp ./rtlbt/* /mnt/lib/firmware/rtl_bt && sync && sudo umount /mnt
    Eject NVME-SSD/sdcard/emmc/USB2-SATA-SSD from PC.

17. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/android       ( Build android image )

18. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/bookworm-flightaware  ( flightaware in bookworm )

19. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/yocto         ( Build yocto desktop image )

20. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/buildroot     ( Build buildroot image )

21. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/bookworm-gpio ( Build bookworm gpio tests )

22. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/fedora        ( Build fedora image )

23. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/ubuntu-uefi   ( Build ubuntu-uefi image )

24. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/bookworm-uefi ( Build bookworm-uefi image )

25. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/trixie-uefi   ( Build trixie-uefi image )

26. cd ~/build-rockpi4b/forky-uefi    ( Build forky-uefi image )
